          %p
            We thus can think of a stack of groupoids as a ‘lax’ generalisation of a sheaf of groupoids. What about
            = succeed "?" do
              %strong gerbes
          %p
            (It should be mentioned that often in topological settings, the sheaf of groups is actually a constant sheaf and that in that case a
            = succeed "-torsor" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi G
